# jay.developer — Cursor Agent Rules
# Drop this file at the root of the Laravel/Inertia/Vue project.
# All agent prompts in PROMPTS.md reference these constraints.

## Stack
- Backend:  Laravel 11, PHP 8.2, Inertia.js
- Frontend: Vue 3 (Composition API + <script setup>), Tailwind CSS v3
- Build:    Vite
- Routing:  Ziggy (route() helper available in JS)
- CMS:      Filament v3 admin panel at /admin

## Design system — tokens (Tailwind extend or CSS vars)
Use these exact values. Do NOT deviate for "close enough" Tailwind defaults.

### Colors
| Token          | Hex       | Usage                          |
|----------------|-----------|--------------------------------|
| bg             | #0f0f11   | Page background                |
| bg-surface     | #16161a   | Card / panel surface           |
| bg-raised      | #1c1c21   | Hover state, nav active        |
| border         | #2a2a32   | Default border                 |
| border-strong  | #38383f   | Emphasis border                |
| text-primary   | #e8e4f0   | Body, headings                 |
| text-secondary | #9994aa   | Muted / supporting text        |
| text-tertiary  | #55505f   | Placeholders, labels           |
| accent         | #7f77dd   | Primary accent (purple)        |
| accent-deep    | #534ab7   | Accent border, deep variant    |
| accent-dim     | #2a2640   | Accent fill (pill bg)          |
| teal           | #1d9e75   | Security / status green        |
| teal-dim       | #0d3326   | Teal fill bg                   |
| teal-border    | #0f6e56   | Teal border                    |

### Typography
- Font: system-ui / 'Segoe UI' for UI; Georgia/serif for resume-page insets only
- Base size: 14px / 1rem
- Eyebrow labels: 11px, weight 600, tracking 0.12em, uppercase, color: accent
- Body copy: 13px, line-height 1.75, color: text-secondary
- Nav links: 13px, color: text-secondary → text-primary on hover
- Skill group label: 11px, weight 600, tracking 0.03em, color: text-secondary

### Spacing rhythm
- Section inner padding: 40px 28px
- Card padding: 18–24px
- Gap between cards: 20px
- Pill gap: 6px

### Component shapes
- Cards: border-radius 12px, border 1px border, bg-surface
- Pills: border-radius 20px (full round), 4px 12px padding
- Nav: height 60px, sticky top-0, border-bottom
- Section dividers: border-bottom 1px border, between every section

## Pill colour rules
- Default pills:      bg accent-dim  | text accent     | border accent-deep
- Security/cyber pills: bg teal-dim  | text teal       | border teal-border
  (Apply teal variant to: "Security & Authorization", "Cybersecurity Certifications" groups)

## Layout rules
- About section:    CSS grid, 1fr + 180px sidebar. Sidebar = avatar card.
- Skills section:   Single column, one card per skill group, pills wrap inside.
- Contact section:  CSS grid 1fr 1fr. Left = email card. Right = logo card.
- Resume section:   Centered column, max-width 440px per page, cream (#faf9f7) bg.

## Nav behaviour
- Sticky, z-index 50
- Logo: "jay<accent-dot>developer" — the dot is accent colour, rest is text-primary
- Links: about · resume · skills · contact · github
- Active/hover: bg-raised background, text-primary colour, border-radius 6px

## DO NOT
- Use Tailwind purples (violet-*, purple-*) — use the exact hex tokens above
- Add gradients, drop-shadows, glow effects, or blur
- Use Inter, Roboto, or Arial
- Add animations beyond CSS transition: all 0.15s on interactive elements
- Nest scrollable containers
- Use font-weight > 700 anywhere

## File targets (existing project structure)
- Page component:     resources/js/Pages/Home.vue
- Data (skills etc):  resources/js/data/skills.js  (extract from props if needed)
- Tailwind config:    tailwind.config.js            (add token extends)
- CSS variables:      resources/css/app.css         (optional, if not using Tailwind extend)
